      propertyPath: noteContent
      value: "They used to dismiss this object as useless, but it is not.\n \nThe
        table puzzle was built around it, and without it the last fuse cannot be
        reached. That was always the trick \u2014 hide something important inside
        something that looks harmless.\r\nIf you have made it this far, do not leave
        it behind. It matters more than it looks.\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
