    - target: {fileID: 676244225140074482, guid: 2290421a90386fe40b7a4497c38b7323, type: 3}
      propertyPath: noteContent
      value: "TO ANYONE WHO FINDS THIS, \r\n\r\nMaintenance record: one emergency
        fuse was moved into this operations room during the blackout and left here
        until power restoration could be attempted. The fuses are required to open
        the theater room and restore power to the locked system. If the facility
        loses power again, this section should be checked first. \r\n\r\nDo not assume
        this room is clear just because nothing is moving right now. The operations
        sector has been unstable since the collapse, and the structure itself is
        beginning to fail. \r\n\r\n\u2014\u202FMaintenance Record "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
