    - target: {fileID: 676244225140074482, guid: 2290421a90386fe40b7a4497c38b7323, type: 3}
      propertyPath: noteContent
      value: "TO ANYONE WHO FINDS THIS,\n\r\nThe master keycard remains with the
        director\u2019s records, locked away with the safe and the tape archive.
        If you want the code for the safe, you need to watch the tape first, because
        the numbers were never written down anywhere else.\n\r\nOnce you have the
        code, open the safe and take what is inside. Control failed the moment Sector
        Null stopped obeying its own systems, and the people in charge believed the
        facility could contain anything. They were wrong.\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
